ERROR: Error ZWEL0105E: The Zowe YAML config file is associated to Zowe runtime "/", which is not same as where zwe command is located "/test/dir"."
`;

exports[`zwe-install (SHORT) zwe install invalid runtime directory 2`] = `
"Temporary directory '/tmp/.zweenv-0000' created.
Zowe will remove it on success, but if zwe exits with a non-zero code manual cleanup would be needed.
